## [v0.7.3 – Settings Page Redesign & Data Deletion UX]
**Date:** 2025-12-23

### Changes Made:
- Restructured account page with left sidebar navigation (General, Password, Privacy & Data tabs)
- Added header with ASTROTASK wordmark linking back to /dashboard
- Centered nav and content layout with 120px top padding for better visual balance
- Renamed /account route to /settings throughout the app (folder, CSS, component, header link)
- Created secondary danger button style (white background, red stroke/text) for "Delete all my data"
- Added hard page refresh after data deletion to clear cached frontend state and prevent "ghost" data
- Fixed Firefox autofill brown highlight on password inputs in delete modals

